# GitHub Actions workflow kept locally but untracked: pushing workflow files
# needs the 'workflow' OAuth scope. Pages currently deploys from the gh-pages
# branch instead. To switch back to Actions: grant the scope, then untrack this
# line and commit .github/workflows/deploy.yml.
.github/workflows/

